###Mapping
Mapping test::kindlygecko::mapping::EnclosureBaseMapping
(
  *test::kindlygecko::domain::Enclosure[enclosure]: Relational
  {
    ~primaryKey
    (
      [test::kindlygecko::store::BurrowDatabase]reference.enclosure.enclosure_code
    )
    ~mainTable [test::kindlygecko::store::BurrowDatabase]reference.enclosure
    enclosureCode: [test::kindlygecko::store::BurrowDatabase]reference.enclosure.enclosure_code,
    enclosureName: [test::kindlygecko::store::BurrowDatabase]reference.enclosure.enclosure_name,
    zoneName: [test::kindlygecko::store::BurrowDatabase]@EnclosureZone | [test::kindlygecko::store::BurrowDatabase]reference.habitat_zone.zone_name,
    registerLabel: 'BURROW-REGISTER'
  }
)
